.TH KATTRI 1 "2026-10-27" "kattri 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kattri \- native client for Jellyfin media servers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kattri
[\fB\-\-profile\fR \fINAME\fR]
[\fIMEDIA\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kattri
browses and plays the libraries of a Jellyfin server. Playback uses the
system libmpv. Server streams pass through a local relay, so libmpv never
receives server credentials.
.PP
On first start, enter the server address and sign in with a password or
Quick Connect. Plain HTTP is accepted only for loopback and private-network
addresses unless explicitly allowed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fINAME\fR, \fB\-\-profile=\fR\fINAME\fR
Use the named local profile. Each profile keeps its own settings, saved
servers and queues.
.TP
.I MEDIA
A local media file to open in the player.
.PP
Any other argument that starts with \fB\-\-\fR is rejected.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KATTRI_LOG
Log level for this run: error, warn, info, debug or trace. The Settings
page sets the default. Logs redact credentials and server addresses.
.SH FILES
Settings, profiles and logs live in the platform configuration and data
directories. The About page in Settings shows the log folder.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpv (1)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/Archerkattri/jellyfin-kattri/issues
